WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.167 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Here's how it works.

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.068 line:92%
Each round, we'll draw a card,

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:04.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
which tells us what face
we both have to make.

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:06.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
We'll look into our mirrors,
make our faces,

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:07.941 size:75% position:38%
and then reveal them
on the count of 3.

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:09.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
We'll stare at each other
for 10 seconds

00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:11.077 line:92%
while trying to hold our faces.

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:13.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
The first person to crack
a smile, laugh,

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:15.415 size:88% position:44% line:92%
or break the face loses.

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:19.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let's see what
our first face is. Ready?

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:22.756 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Curious beaver.

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:33.166 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
3, 2, 1...

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:35.869 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:42.675 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Buzzer ]

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:44.144 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Who won?

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:47.981 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-You won, you won.

00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:48.615 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-The strain.

00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:51.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's such strain to
make those faces.

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:53.686 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Strains ]

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:58.191 line:92%
-Okay. Disappointed grandma.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.904 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
3, 2, 1...

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:13.873 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:17.644 --> 00:01:20.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Buzzer ]
♪♪♪♪

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:27.087 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What is that?
-It's so stupid. I don't know.

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:29.289 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Why is it so hard
to keep a face?

00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:35.128 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, this one is
chicken laying an egg.

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:50.977 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, my goodness.

00:01:50.977 --> 00:01:54.948 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-3, 2, 1...

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:58.918 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:00.987 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:00.987 --> 00:02:04.124 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, my God.

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:09.529 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Last one here is...
[ Both laugh ]

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:12.732 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
...stunned turtle.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:25.145 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Mm-hmm.

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:28.314 size:78% position:39% line:92%
All right, 3, 2, 1...

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:31.284 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:36.256 --> 00:02:37.056 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:41.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
Kenan Thompson.
♪♪♪♪

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:42.695 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I love you, buddy.

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:45.798 line:92%
Kenan Thompson, everybody.

